                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "68b95e1d-13f7-39a6-a394-f3a794a75b7d",
                        "entry_id": "c7f45f3c-1404-38d7-bb0d-a7b1202f1c3d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personnage froid, distant, sans émotion et cynique mais attentionné envers les personnes qu’il aime."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Fiction japonaise"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a57e63ac-b89e-4981-b086-4716cd16c23a",
                                "sense_id": "68b95e1d-13f7-39a6-a394-f3a794a75b7d",
                                "text": "Les Kuuderes parlent souvent d’une voix calme et monotone et ne semblent pas affectés par le monde qui les entoure. Ils ne semblent jamais trop heureux, excités ou surpris - tout comme ils ne paraissent jamais tristes, ennuyés ou en colère. Les exemples extrêmes peuvent même sembler complètement sans sentiments."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33539928-15a1-45c7-9da6-a8b29a7181a8",
                                "sense_id": "68b95e1d-13f7-39a6-a394-f3a794a75b7d",
                                "text": "La kuudere est un personnage froid, distant, impassible, parfois sarcastique ou cynique. On la confond souvent avec la dandere, qui elle a du mal à interagir avec les autres -ce qui lui vaut souvent le qualificatif réducteur de \"timide\"."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2480dfed-20b9-4204-a3d0-ea29c7d9adab",
                        "source_entry_id": "c7f45f3c-1404-38d7-bb0d-a7b1202f1c3d",
                        "source_sense_id": "68b95e1d-13f7-39a6-a394-f3a794a75b7d",
                        "target_lang_word": "kuudere",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kuudere",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a7230f0-5e45-3e1a-8be0-f84b7654cd9c",
                                        "entry_id": "06adccfb-6c9c-3cca-8e17-43bc589c72be",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A calm, aloof, reserved fictional character (usually a girl) who has a hidden soft side, especially for a love interest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Japanese"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2420faa8-70fe-4e9f-96d9-e2c495a29272",
                                                "sense_id": "5a7230f0-5e45-3e1a-8be0-f84b7654cd9c",
                                                "text": "Her words were as cool as ever, but there was a hint of embarrassment in her voice. Could she be one of those “kuuderes” I'd heard so much abou"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4ea3491-5bf8-4b6b-8314-d1209637d4b4",
                                                "sense_id": "5a7230f0-5e45-3e1a-8be0-f84b7654cd9c",
                                                "text": "True, she wasn't very expressive—or anyway, I didn't feel like I saw a lot of emotion from her—but if I thought of her as a kuudere, or one of those “weird girl” types, that could actually be seen as a positive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79e920c8-4588-4b14-baa5-b22b6b671f67",
                                                "sense_id": "5a7230f0-5e45-3e1a-8be0-f84b7654cd9c",
                                                "text": "The cool and tough exterior she displays makes for a good kuudere, and the blue eyes and silver hair already sets her up for the role in the Clannad series."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
